{"url": "https://webaim.org/training/docs/", "silo": "webaim", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n\t\t<title>WebAIM: Accessible Documents: Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat</title>\n\t<link rel=\"shortcut icon\" href=\"/media/favicon.ico\">\n\t<link rel=\"home\" href=\"/\">\n\t<link rel=\"search\" href=\"/search/\">\n\t<link rel=\"alternate\" href=\"https://webaim.org/blog/feed\" type=\"application/rss+xml\" title=\"WebAIM Blog\">\n\n\t<script async=\"\" src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-Y41PF8WV9X\"></script>\n\t<script>\n  \twindow.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];\n  \tfunction gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);}\n  \tgtag('js', new Date());\n  \tgtag('config', 'G-Y41PF8WV9X');\n\t</script>\n\t\n\t<link href=\"/styles/main.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/print.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"print\">\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/jquery.js\"></script>\n\t<script src=\"/media/scripts/main.js\"></script>\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:400\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Kameron:400,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n\t<link href=\"/styles/documents.css?ver=2\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\t\t<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Open+Sans:400,400i,700\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n<style>\n#related {\n\tpadding: 5px 10px 5px 20px;\n}\n#related ul {\n\tmargin-left: 30px;\n}\n.register {\n\t\ttext-align:center;\n\t\tfont-size:1.5em;\n\t\tbackground-color:#E4E5EA;\n\t\tpadding:5px;\n\t\tborder:#ccc solid 1px;\n\t\tmargin:0;\n}\nblockquote img {\n\tmargin: 0 .5em;\n}\nblockquote a {\n\tfloat: right;\n\ttext-decoration: underline;\n\tcolor: #203990;\n}\n.pullquote {\n\twidth: 90%;\n\tline-height:160%;\n\tmargin: 1.5em 0 1.5em 0;\n\tpadding: .75em .5em .5em 2em;\n\tfont-family:Georgia,Times,serif;\n\ttext-indent: -2em;\n\tbackground-color:#E4E5EA;\n}\n\ni {\n\tfloat: right;\n\tpadding-right: .75em;\n}\narticle h2 {\n\tmargin-bottom: 12px;\n}\narticle h4 {\n\tmargin: 2em auto 1em auto;\n\tborder-bottom: none;\n\tfont-size: 1.1em;\n\tfont-weight: normal;\n\ttext-align: center;\n}\narticle h4.short {\n\tmargin: 0 auto 1em auto;\n}\narticle table {\n\twidth: 80%;\n\tmargin: 30px auto 12px auto;\n\ttext-align: center;\n\tborder: .5px solid #666;\n}\narticle th {\n\tborder: 1px solid #333;\n}\narticle td {\n\tborder: .5px solid #666;\n}\n.notop {\n\tmargin: 0 0 1.5em 0;\n}\n\n.note .question {\n\tbackground:url(/media/template/bg_question.svg) no-repeat;\n\tcolor:#1C205B;\n\tpadding:3px 0 15px 50px;\n\tdisplay:block;\n\tfont-weight: bold;\n\tfont-style: italic;\n\tfont-size: 1.25em;\n}\n.note .feedback {\n\tbackground:url(images/bg_feedback.svg) no-repeat;\n\tcolor:#1C205B;\n\tpadding:3px 0 15px 50px;\n\tdisplay:block;\n\tfont-weight: bold;\n\tfont-style: italic;\n\tfont-size: 1.25em;\n}\n.important {\n\tborder-color: #333333;\n}\n.important .note {\n\tpadding: 12px 1.5em 0px 1.5em;\n}\n.important .learn {\n\tbackground:url(images/bg_lightbulb.svg) no-repeat;\n\tcolor:#333333;\n\tpadding:3px 0 15px 50px;\n\tdisplay:block;\n\tfont-weight: bold;\n\tfont-size: 1.25em;\n}\n.half {\n\twidth: 50%;\n}\n.top5em {\n\tmargin-top:5em;\n}\n.top4em {\n\tmargin-top:4.5em;\n}\n.top3em {\n\tmargin-top:3.5em;\n}\n.top2em {\n\tmargin-top:2.5em;\n}\n.top1em {\n\tmargin-top:1.5em;\n}\n.moreMargin4 {\n\tmargin: 4em auto 4em auto;\n}\n.moreMargin2 {\n\tmargin: 1em auto 2em auto;\n}\n.video {\n\twidth: 50%;\n\tmargin: .75em 0 0 .25em;\n}\n.module {\n\twidth: 45%;\n\tmargin: .75em 0 0 .5em;\n}\n.scholarship {\n\twidth: 50%;\n\tmargin: .5em 0 0 .5em;\n} \n</style>\n\n<!--[if lt IE 9]>\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"http://html5shiv.googlecode.com/svn/trunk/html5.js\"></script>\n<![endif]-->\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async=\"\" src=\"https://googleads.g.doubleclick.net/pagead/viewthroughconversion/1069381703/?random=1774685935876&amp;cv=11&amp;fst=1774685935876&amp;bg=ffffff&amp;guid=ON&amp;async=1&amp;en=gtag.config&amp;gtm=45je63q0h2v899903185za200zd899903185xec&amp;gcd=13l3l3l3l1l1&amp;dma=0&amp;tag_exp=0~115938466~115938469~117384406~117484252&amp;u_w=1080&amp;u_h=600&amp;url=https%3A%2F%2Fwebaim.org%2Ftraining%2Fdocs%2F&amp;frm=0&amp;tiba=WebAIM%3A%20Accessible%20Documents%3A%20Word%2C%20PowerPoint%2C%20%26%20Acrobat&amp;hn=www.googleadservices.com&amp;npa=0&amp;pscdl=noapi&amp;auid=301195456.1774685902&amp;uaa=x86&amp;uab=64&amp;uafvl=Chromium%3B145.0.7632.6%7CNot%253AA-Brand%3B99.0.0.0&amp;uamb=0&amp;uam=&amp;uap=Linux&amp;uapv=&amp;uaw=0&amp;data=event%3Dgtag.config&amp;rfmt=3&amp;fmt=4\"></script></head>\n<body>\n\n\n<div id=\"headcontainer\" class=\"clearfix\" style=\"background-image: url(/media/banners/online.jpg)\">\n<header>\n\t<div id=\"skiptocontent\"><a href=\"#maincontent\">skip to main content</a></div>\n\t\n\t<h2><a href=\"/\"><img src=\"/media/logo.png\" width=\"630\" height=\"167\" alt=\"WebAIM - Web Accessibility In Mind\"></a></h2>\n\n\t<nav>\n\t\t<h2 class=\"hidden\">Main Navigation</h2>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/\">Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/articles/\">Articles</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/\">Resources</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/projects/\">Projects</a></li>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/community/\">Community</a></li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</nav>\n\t<div id=\"search\">\n\t\t<form method=\"get\" role=\"search\" action=\"/search/\" id=\"sitesearch\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"search\"><span><label for=\"q\">Search:</label> <input type=\"text\" name=\"q\" id=\"q\"><input type=\"image\" src=\"/media/template/search.svg\" alt=\"Submit Search\"></span></p>\n\t\t</form>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"intro\"><a href=\"/intro\">Introduction to Web Accessibility</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p class=\"training\"><a href=\"/services/training\">WebAIM Training</a></p>\n\t</div>\n\n</header>\n</div>\n\n<main id=\"maincontainer\" class=\"clearfix\">\n\n<article id=\"maincontent\">\n\n<h1>Accessible Documents: Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat</h1>\n\n<p id=\"breadcrumbs\"><span class=\"hidden\">You are here: </span><a href=\"/\">Home</a> &gt; <a href=\"/services/\">Services</a> &gt; <a href=\"/services/training/#online\">Accessibility Training</a> &gt; Accessible Documents: Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat</p>\n\n\n<nav>\n\t\n\t<ol>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"#overview\">Overview</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"#delivery\">Delivery</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"#structure\">Structure</a></li>\n\t\t<li><a href=\"#assessments\">Assessments, Certificates, &amp; CEUs</a>\n\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#certificates\">Certificates of Completion</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#CEUs\">Continuing Education Units</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t</li>\n        <li><a href=\"#enrollment\">Enrollment</a>\n\t\t</li><li><a href=\"#groupTraining\">Group Training</a>\n\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#groupPricing\">Group Pricing</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"#groupSupport\">Group Support Services</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t</li>\n        <li><a href=\"#freeTraining\">Free Training for People with Disabilities</a>\n\t</li></ol>\n\t\t\n</nav>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"overview\">\n\t<h2>Overview</h2>\n\t<p>This independent-study online training covers principles and processes for:</p>\n\t<span>\n\t\t<img src=\"images/listing.png\" alt=\"Word, PowerPoint, &amp; Acrobat logos\" width=\"1050\" height=\"768\" class=\"floatright top2em\">\n\t\t<ul class=\"half\">\n\t\t\t<li><strong>Creating</strong> accessible document content and structure in Word &amp; PowerPoint.</li>\n\t\t\t<li><strong>Evaluating</strong> the accessibility of well-structured Word &amp; PowerPoint documents.</li>\n\t\t\t<li><strong>Optimizing</strong> the accessibility of PDFs exported from well-structured Word &amp; PowerPoint documents with Acrobat.</li>\n\t\t\t<li><strong>Creating</strong> accessible document content and structure in Excel (bonus module).</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t</span>\n\t<p>This course is designed for adult learners that have experience creating Word &amp; PowerPoint documents. Web development or design experience is not required.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"note moreMargin2\">\n    <div class=\"feedback\">\n        What are people saying about the course?\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"more\">Read <a href=\"quotes\">feedback from some of over 15,000 course participants</a>.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"delivery\">\n\t<h2>Delivery</h2>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"https://www.instructure.com/product/higher-education/canvas-catalog\"><img src=\"images/canvas.png\" alt=\"canvas\" width=\"1641\" height=\"2057\" class=\"floatright top1em\"></a></p>\n\t\t<p>The course is delivered through the Canvas Catalog learning management system. Enrolled participants have 24/7 access to technical support for Catalog in English and Spanish.</p>\n\n\t\t<p><strong>New cohorts start on the first Monday of each month</strong> unless there is a U.S. holiday that week. Participants have 60 business days (excluding weekends &amp; US holidays) to complete the course.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"important moreMargin2\">\n\t<div class=\"learn\">\n\t\tStart learning today\n\t</div>\n\t<p>Easy self-enrollment is available at <a href=\"//webaim.learn.usu.edu/\">WebAIM's Online Course</a> page.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"structure\">\n\t<h2>Structure</h2>\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<blockquote class=\"pullquote half floatright video\"><img src=\"images/openquote2.png\" alt=\"open quote\"> I like that you had so many tools available. There was the video, the electronic output on the page to review, copies of the documents you could download and follow along. That's the most information I've had available for a course before.<img src=\"images/closequote2.png\" alt=\"close quote\"><br>\n\t\t\t<i>January 2025 training participant</i><br>\n\t\t</blockquote>\n\t\t\n\t\t<p>This video-based training features 39 learning activities with an average video length of five minutes. These videos have open captions and are accompanied by descriptive, multimedia transcripts.</p>\n\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t<p>The course is organized into four main modules and one bonus module:</p>\n\n\t<h3 id=\"mod1\">Module 1: Document Content</h3>\n\t<p><strong>Objective:</strong>&nbsp;Review basic principles and processes for optimizing the accessibility of document content in Microsoft Word and PowerPoint.</p>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Section 1: Overview of Document Accessibility</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 2: Images</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 3: Hyperlinks</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 4: Contrast &amp; Color Reliance</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 5: Optimizing Writing</li>\n  </ul>\n\t<h3 id=\"mod2\">Module Two: Document Structure</h3>\n\t<p><strong>Objective:</strong>&nbsp;Review&nbsp;basic principles and processes for optimizing the accessibility of document structure in Microsoft Word and PowerPoint.</p>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Section 1: Headings in Word</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 2: Optimizing PowerPoint Presentations\n\t\t</li><li>Section 3: Lists &amp; Columns</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 4: Tables</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t<h3 id=\"mod3\">Module Three: Evaluating Accessibility &amp; Creating PDFs</h3>\n\t<p><strong>Objective:</strong>&nbsp;Review processes for utilizing built-in accessibility checkers and an evaluation checklist, installing Adobe PDF Maker, and exporting PDF documents.</p>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Section 1: Evaluating Accessibility</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 2: Practicing Evaluation &amp; Repair</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 3: Creating PDFs</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t<h3 id=\"mod4\">Module Four: Optimizing PDFs in Acrobat</h3>\n\t<p><strong>Objective:</strong>&nbsp;Review how to configure Adobe Acrobat Professional, and how to use it to optimize a PDF exported from a well-structured Microsoft Word or PowerPoint document.</p>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Section 1: Introduction to Optimizing PDFs</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 2: Checking Accessibility</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 3: Reading Order Tool</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 4: Content Order and Tags Order</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t<h3 id=\"mod5\">Module Five: Accessible Excel (bonus module)</h3>\n\t<p><strong>Objective:</strong>&nbsp;Review basic principles and processes for optimizing document structure, and for utilizing a built-in accessibility checker, in Excel documents.</p>\n\t<ul>\n\t\t<li>Section 1: Navigating in Excel</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 2: Sheets &amp; Tables</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 3: Images &amp; Links</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 4: Charts</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 5: Optimizing Workbooks</li>\n\t\t<li>Section 6: Evaluating Accessibility in Excel</li>\n\t</ul>\n\t\n\t<blockquote class=\"pullquote half floatright module\"><img src=\"images/openquote2.png\" alt=\"open quote\">The timing of the learning modules was perfect. I needed time to learn, and it had to fit into my busy work schedule.<img src=\"images/closequote2.png\" alt=\"close quote\"><br>\n\t\t<i>2023 training participant</i><br>\n\t</blockquote>\n\n\t<p>One new module is opened each week during the first five weeks of the course. Each module takes between 2 and 4 hours for most participants to complete. The average time to complete the four main modules is 10 hours.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"assessments\">\n\t<h2>Assessments, Certificates, &amp; CEUs</h2>\n\t<p>Participants demonstrate their mastery of the course materials through multiple-choice assessments. Each section of the course has a quiz with between four and eight questions based on its objectives. Each module has a ten-question exam that randomly selects questions from each of the module's section quizzes. Participants pass the course by meeting the following requirements for the <strong>four main modules</strong>:</p>\n\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li>All section quiz scores are 100% (with unlimited retakes).</li>\n\t\t\t<li>All module exam scores are 80% or better (with one retake per exam).</li>\n\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<h3 id=\"certificates\">Certificates of Completion</h3>\n            <p><img src=\"images/cert-sample.png\" alt=\"certificate of completion sample\" width=\"142\" height=\"110\" class=\"floatright top1em\"></p>\n\t\t\t<p>Participants that pass the course are eligible to be awarded a <strong>Certificate of Completion</strong>. These certificates allow individuals and/or organizations to document mastery of the course content and proficiency in creating accessible web documents in common formats.</p>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<h3 id=\"CEUs\">Continuing Education Units</h3>\n\t\t\t<p>Participants that meet the assessment requirements are eligible to be awarded <strong>1.5 Continuing Education Units</strong> through the <a href=\"https://itls.usu.edu/\">Instructional Technology and Learning Sciences department</a> at Utah State University. The registration of a CEU requires an additional recording fee of $45.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"enrollment\">\n\t<h2>Enrollment</h2>\n\t<p><a href=\"https://www.authorize.net/\"><img src=\"images/authorizeNet.png\" alt=\"authorize.net | verified merchant\" width=\"184\" height=\"150\" class=\"floatright top1em\"></a></p>\n\t<p>Individual course enrollments are <strong>US$ 125</strong>. Self-enrollment through a <strong>secure credit card payment</strong> is available at <a href=\"//webaim.learn.usu.edu/\">WebAIM's Online Course</a> page.</p><p>\n\t\t\n\t</p><p>Please contact us directly for payment by <a href=\"/contact/?subject=Payment%20by%20check\">check</a>, <a href=\"/contact/?subject=Payment%20by%20purchase%20order\">purchase order</a>, or <a href=\"/contact/?subject=Payment%20by%20wire%20transfer\">wire transfer</a>. Prepaid enrollments valid for 12 months are available.</p>\n\t\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"groupTraining\">\n\t\n    <h2>Group Training</h2>\n    <p>We specialize in training groups of 100 or more participants, and offer discounted pricing based on group size.</p>\n\n        <h3 id=\"groupPricing\" class=\"short\">Group Pricing</h3>\n\t\t\t\n        <table>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Group Size</th>\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Enrollment</th>\n                    <th scope=\"col\">Discount</th>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"row\">100 to 250</th>\n                    <td>$100</td>\n                    <td>20%</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"row\">251 to 500</th>\n                    <td>$75</td>\n                    <td>40%</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr>\n                    <th scope=\"row\">Over 500</th>\n                    <td>$50</td>\n                    <td>60%</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table><br>\n    \n        <h3 id=\"groupSupport\" class=\"short\">Group Support Services</h3>\n\n        <p><strong>Clients that train groups of 100 or more </strong>also receive additional support services:</p>\n            <ul>\n                <li>Enrollment period extended from 12 to 18 months.</li>\n                <li><a href=\"/training/online/sample/course/registration\">Custom registration pages</a> facilitate self-enrollments.</li>\n                <li>Certificates of Completion automatically issued for qualifying participants.</li>\n                <li>Reporting on participant outcomes available online.</li>\n            </ul>\n    \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section\" id=\"freeTraining\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t<h2>Free Training for People with Disabilities</h2>\n\t\t\n        <blockquote class=\"pullquote notop half floatright scholarship\"><img src=\"images/openquote2.png\" alt=\"open quote\">Being a person with a disability, I\u2019m always looking for new ways to make my training products accessible to all. Taking this training gave me the opportunity to create accessible templates, to help my colleagues create accessible documents.<img src=\"images/closequote2.png\" alt=\"close quote\"><br>\n            <i>Scholarship Program participant</i><br>\n        </blockquote>\n\n        <p>People with disabilities may enroll in the course <strong>without cost</strong> through our <a href=\"/training/docs/scholarship\">Scholarship Program</a>. The scholarship program was launched in 2020. To date, participants from six continents and more than a dozen countries have been enrolled through this program.</p>\n</div>\t\t\n\n<div class=\"note moreMargin4\">\n    <div class=\"question\">\n        Questions?\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"more\">Contact us with <a href=\"/contact/?subject=Question%20about%20the%20online%20course\">questions about this course</a>.</p>\n\n</div>\n\t\n\n</article>\n<!--\n\t-->\n<aside id=\"articlemeta\">\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div id=\"related\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Related Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/training/#docs-training\">Virtual Document Accessibility Training</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/resources/evaloffice/\">Word &amp; PowerPoint Evaluation Guide</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n</aside>\n</main>\n\n<footer>\n\t<div id=\"footerresources\">\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"copyright\">\u00a92026 WebAIM</h2>\n\t\t\t<p id=\"contact\">\t\t\tUtah State University<br>\n\t\t\t6807 Old Main Hill<br>\n\t\t\tLogan, UT 84322-6807<br>\n\t\t\t<a class=\"phone\" href=\"tel:4357977024\">435.797.7024</a></p>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"checkpage\">\n\t\t\t<h2>Check Your Accessibility</h2>\n\t\t\t<form action=\"https://wave.webaim.org/report\" novalidate=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t<label for=\"waveurl\">Web site address:</label>\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"url\" id=\"waveurl\" name=\"url\" title=\"Web site address\">\n\t\t\t\t<input type=\"submit\" value=\"WAVE\">\n\t\t\t</form>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"blog\">From the Blog</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul><li><a href=\"/blog/a-new-path/\">A New Path for Digital Accessibility?</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/2026-predictions/\">2026 Predictions: The Next Big Shifts in Web Accessibility</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/word-and-powerpoint-alt-text-roundup/\">Word and PowerPoint Alt Text Roundup</a></li><li><a href=\"/blog/accessibility-by-design/\">Accessibility by Design: Preparing K\u201312 Schools for What\u2019s Next</a></li></ul>\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"footerblock\">\n\t\t\t<h2 id=\"popular\">Popular Resources</h2>\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/services/training/\">WebAIM Training</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/standards/wcag/checklist\">WCAG 2 Checklist</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/newsletter\">WebAIM Monthly Newsletter</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/contrastchecker\">Color Contrast Checker</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"/resources/designers/\">Web Accessibility for Designers</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a href=\"http://wave.webaim.org/\">WAVE Web Accessibility Evaluation Tool</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div id=\"footerlinks\">\n\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footercontact\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerabout\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerrss\" href=\"/community/rss\">RSS Feeds</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footerli\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/webaim/\">LinkedIn</a></li>\n\t\t\t\t<li><a id=\"footercopyright\" href=\"/copyright\">Copyright &amp; Terms of Use</a></li>\n\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"clear\"></div>\n\t</div>\n\n</footer>\n\n\n<flying-focus id=\"flying-focus\" style=\"transition-duration: 0.1s;\"></flying-focus></body></html>", "links": [{"href": "https://webaim.org/training/docs/", "text": "skip to main content", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction_error": null, "intrinsic_score": 0.0, "contextual_score": null, "total_score": null}, {"href": "https://webaim.org/", "text": "", "title": "", "base_domain": "webaim.org", "head_data": null, "head_extraction_status": null, "head_extraction